<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>종말예언 : 어둠탐사기록</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    background: #000;
    height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif;
    color: #eee;
  }

  /* 실제로 스크롤할 공간을 만들어주는 컨테이너
     장면 개수만큼 100vh씩 늘려주면 됨 (지금은 3장면 = 300vh) */
  .scroll-space {
    height: 300vh;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* 화면에 고정되는 뷰포트 */
  .sticky-viewport {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #000;
  }

  .phrase {
    position: absolute;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 0 1.5em;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .phrase.visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* ==============================
     글리치 효과
  ============================== */
  .phrase.glitch {
    animation: glitchJitter 0.15s infinite;
  }

  .phrase.glitch::before,
  .phrase.glitch::after {
    content: attr(data-text);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .phrase.glitch::before {
    color: #ff2b4a;
    clip-path: inset(0 0 60% 0);
    transform: translate(-3px, -2px);
    animation: glitchSliceA 0.4s infinite linear alternate-reverse;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
  }

  .phrase.glitch::after {
    color: #2bd7ff;
    clip-path: inset(40% 0 0 0);
    transform: translate(3px, 2px);
    animation: glitchSliceB 0.5s infinite linear alternate-reverse;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
  }

  @keyframes glitchJitter {
    0%   { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    20%  { transform: translate(-1px, 1px); }
    40%  { transform: translate(1px, -1px); }
    60%  { transform: translate(-1px, -1px); }
    80%  { transform: translate(1px, 1px); }
    100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
  }

  @keyframes glitchSliceA {
    0%   { clip-path: inset(10% 0 70% 0); }
    30%  { clip-path: inset(50% 0 20% 0); }
    60%  { clip-path: inset(5% 0 85% 0); }
    100% { clip-path: inset(30% 0 40% 0); }
  }

  @keyframes glitchSliceB {
    0%   { clip-path: inset(70% 0 5% 0); }
    30%  { clip-path: inset(20% 0 55% 0); }
    60%  { clip-path: inset(85% 0 2% 0); }
    100% { clip-path: inset(45% 0 25% 0); }
  }

  /* 스크롤 유도 힌트 (선택사항) */
  .scroll-hint {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #666;
    opacity: 0.7;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; }
    50% { opacity: 0.8; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="scroll-space">
  <div class="sticky-viewport">
    <!-- 장면 1: 첫 문구 -->
    <div class="phrase" data-scene="0">
      이 모든 건 우리의 졸업식날 일어났다.<br>
      (예: 조용한 문장)
    </div>

    <!-- 장면 2: 글리치 문구 -->
    <div class="phrase" data-scene="1" data-text="여기에 글리치 문구를 입력하세요.">
